 183          /**
 184           * @brief  Configures the ADC Reference voltage gear.
 185           * @param  ADC_Vref[in]: specifies the ADC Reference voltage.
 186           *            - ADC_VREF_VDD: ADC reference voltage is VDD 
 187           *            - ADC_VREF_2_4V: ADC reference voltage is 2.4V
 188           * SC92F859x,SC92F759x,SC92F848x,SC92F748x,SC92L853x,SC92L753x,SC92R511x,SC92F646x,SC92F546x,SC92F542x,SC9
